  "details": "It is wasteful and time consuming to have to insert separate nodes to break out multiple properties for a value.  It would be helpful if there was a node which took one instance and broke out all property values for that instance (for example, DateTime can be broken out into 10+ different properties. If you wanted to make a date/time display, you'd have to have 3-6 property read nodes, which could be more simply represented as a single node which provides all properties.)",
